# GitHub issue workflow

Full playbook: `.cursor/skills/issue-workflow/SKILL.md`.
Follow it whenever working on issues from nomotomo/softogram.

Quick reference:

- Backlog lives at https://github.com/nomotomo/softogram/issues; list with `gh issue list -R nomotomo/softogram`.
- Priority order P0 > P1 > P2; prefer `agent-ready` labeled issues.
- Each issue links its audit doc under `docs/audit/` or `docs/growth/` - read the linked section before coding.
- Reproduce the bug first, branch as `fix/issue-<n>-<slug>`, keep diffs minimal, `data-testid` on new interactive elements.
- Mandatory gate before PR: `cd e2e && npm test` (Playwright + mocked SendGrid) must pass; add a test for the acceptance criteria.
- PR must say `Closes #<n>` and list remaining human-only steps (DNS, dashboards, certs).
